---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<Base
  title={`Kilimanjaro & the Wild North — 9-Day Trek & Safari | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`A 9-day Tanzania journey — trek the Machame route towards the summit of Kilimanjaro, then unwind on safari in Ngorongoro and Tarangire. Day-by-day itinerary and prices from $8,600.`}
  ogTitle={`Kilimanjaro & the Wild North — 9-Day Trek & Safari | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`Summit Africa's highest peak, then safari beneath its snows — a 9-day journey from $8,600.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/tz-kilimanjaro.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/kilimanjaro-wild-north.html`}
  jsonld={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TouristTrip","name":"Kilimanjaro & the Wild North — 9-Day Trek & Safari","description":"A 9-day Tanzania journey trekking the Machame route on Kilimanjaro followed by a northern safari.","image":"https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/tz-kilimanjaro.jpg","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Rendile Travels"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"8600","priceCurrency":"USD"}}`}
  credit={`Imagery via Wikimedia Commons: Kilimanjaro © Sergey Pesterev; Ngorongoro © Eric Kilby; Serengeti © Tanzania GET Safaris; Tarangire © Leyo. Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY</a> / <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY-SA</a>.`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-kilimanjaro.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Tanzania · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Kilimanjaro &amp; the Wild North</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>9 days</b></span>
        <span>Machame route · Ngorongoro · Tarangire</span>
        <span>Trek &amp; safari</span>
        <span>from <b>$8,600</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Kilimanjaro%20%26%20the%20Wild%20North" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="tanzania.html">Tanzania</a> / Kilimanjaro &amp; the Wild North</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Stand on the roof of Africa, then come back down to earth on safari. Six days on the scenic Machame route to Uhuru Peak, fully supported, followed by the elephants of Tarangire and the wildlife of the Ngorongoro Crater.</p>
        <p>A bucket-list challenge with a soft landing — our guides, porters and pacing are built around getting you up safely and savouring every step.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 9-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Moshi</h3><p>Met at Kilimanjaro Airport and taken to a comfortable hotel at the mountain's foot for a full kit check and briefing.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Moshi hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Machame Gate to Machame Camp</h3><p>Into the rainforest belt — a lush, gentle first day to ease your legs and lungs into the climb.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mountain camp (~3,000m) · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To Shira Plateau</h3><p>Out of the forest onto open moorland, with the first big views of the summit ahead.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mountain camp (~3,840m) · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Lava Tower &amp; Barranco</h3><p>Climb high to Lava Tower then descend to Barranco — "walk high, sleep low" to acclimatise well.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Barranco camp (~3,960m) · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Barranco Wall to Karanga</h3><p>The famous wall scramble, then a shorter day to rest and hydrate before the push for the summit.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Karanga camp (~3,960m) · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Summit night</h3><p>A midnight start under the stars to reach Uhuru Peak (5,895m) at sunrise — the roof of Africa — then a long descent to camp.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mweka camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Descend &amp; transfer to Tarangire</h3><p>Down through the forest to the gate and your summit certificate, then drive to Tarangire to swap boots for binoculars.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Tarangire lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 8</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Ngorongoro Crater</h3><p>A full day on the crater floor among lions, rhino and elephant — a triumphant, restful finale.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Ngorongoro crater-rim lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 9</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly home</h3><p>Transfer to Kilimanjaro Airport for your onward flight, legs aching and heart full.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Lodges &amp; mountain camps</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Kilimanjaro%20%26%20the%20Wild%20North"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Supported mountain camps</h3><p>Quality tents, mess &amp; full crew on the climb.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Kilimanjaro%20%26%20the%20Wild%20North"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Ngorongoro crater-rim lodge</h3><p>Warm comfort after the descent.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Kilimanjaro%20%26%20the%20Wild%20North"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Tarangire lodge</h3><p>A gentle return to safari luxury.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>All transfers &amp; the Tarangire/Ngorongoro safari leg</li>
          <li>Full Machame climb crew (guides, porters, cook)</li>
          <li>Park, camping &amp; rescue fees</li>
          <li>Quality tents &amp; mess tent on the mountain</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Private 4x4 &amp; guide on safari</li>
          <li>Summit certificate &amp; pulse-oximeter monitoring</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; staff gratuities guidance</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$8,600 per person sharing</strong>; single supplement available. International flights, visas, personal trekking gear and tips for the mountain crew are extra. Best climbing windows: January–March &amp; June–October.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Reach the roof of Africa.</h2><p>Tell us your fitness and timeline and we'll choose the safest route and pace for you.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Kilimanjaro%20%26%20the%20Wild%20North" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More journeys</p><h2 class="section__title">Other Tanzania itineraries</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="classic-northern-circuit.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-ngorongoro.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Classic Northern Circuit</h3><p>8 days · Serengeti, Ngorongoro &amp; Tarangire.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="tanzania-great-migration.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-serengeti.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>The Great Migration</h3><p>7 days · Serengeti river crossings.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="tanzania.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-tarangire.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All Tanzania itineraries</h3><p>Browse every Tanzania journey.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
